// PortfolioAI — environment variable template
// NAMES AND EMPTY PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. Never commit a real value to this file.
// Real values live only in the secure secret store / local untracked .env file.
//
// Note: the platform reserves the VITE_ and SUPABASE_ prefixes for its own
// managed integrations, so PortfolioAI's dedicated-project variables use the
// PORTFOLIOAI_ prefix. Values are entered via the secure secret store.

# --- Dedicated Supabase project (publishable key only; RLS is the boundary) ---
PORTFOLIOAI_SUPABASE_URL=
PORTFOLIOAI_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Deliberately NOT used in Phase 0/1 ---
# PORTFOLIOAI_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=   # requires written justification first

# --- Later phases (do not add values until that phase begins) ---
# ANGEL_ONE_API_KEY=
# ANGEL_ONE_CLIENT_ID=
# TRENDLYNE_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
